Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,W女神的男人高潮技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.01,0:01:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们超久不见了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.61,0:01:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,最近好吗 不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.35,0:01:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.85,0:01:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我最近觉得好无聊哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你最近有和男人上床吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.06,0:01:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,最近吗..我上次碰到一个\N很好玩的男人哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.43,0:01:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,谁？谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.66,0:01:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,一个超敏感的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.97,0:02:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你把他吃啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好像很美味的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.74,0:02:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他真的超敏感的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一直狂叫好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.95,0:02:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢看男人那种表情了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.62,0:02:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,看了都兴奋起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.35,0:02:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,比起自己觉得舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.82,0:02:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,还是让对方舒服比较好对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊，尤其是男人被弄的\N叫出来的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.60,0:02:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,超棒的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.67,0:02:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,最近的男人真的很无趣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,以前的话就不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.07,0:02:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊，以前就不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.01,0:02:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,以前我还曾经坐在男人身上\N把他弄到射出来哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.91,0:02:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.08,0:02:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这种人就很少了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.82,0:02:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好想和这种人上床哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.42,0:02:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好想和他们上床哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.89,0:02:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你有玩过什么奇怪的玩法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.49,0:03:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的玩法..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前有认识一个法国人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,法国人！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.67,0:03:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,很大吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,还蛮大的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.47,0:03:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那个法国人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他超爱被弄屁眼哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.15,0:03:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我就把手指插进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.38,0:03:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样、怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没玩屁眼欸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.35,0:03:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉超不可思议的可是\N他好像很爽的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.69,0:03:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,M男啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.39,0:03:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,超开心的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真好，一定很享受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,真羡慕你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,理沙，你有什么绝招吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.07,0:03:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,说到我一定会用的招式的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,口交
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是我一定会做的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.72,0:03:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会说美味之类的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:04:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那美纱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.99,0:04:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我会舔对方的乳头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.69,0:04:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好开心的样子哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.30,0:04:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要是不这样做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.43,0:04:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得兴奋不起来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.74,0:04:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,看到对方很舒服的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,才会让我也跟着兴奋起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉真的差很多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,还有其他的什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,像是姿势之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.62,0:04:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是骑乘位了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.45,0:04:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一定要的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.89,0:04:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢自己在下面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得少了什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.13,0:04:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,还是想从上面看着对方嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,会想看他舒服的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.67,0:04:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢男人舒服时的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.61,0:04:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,会让人很兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.35,0:05:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就像小狗一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.75,0:05:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这样聊天让我突然觉得\N好想要哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.23,0:05:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,的确啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.39,0:05:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有男人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.03,0:05:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有男人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.27,0:05:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有M型的男人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他很像哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.55,0:05:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,把他拉过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.16,0:05:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.93,0:05:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可以过来一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.10,0:05:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,过来、过来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下、坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这位小哥，你喜欢被女人\N玩弄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.18,0:06:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么说呢..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你不讨厌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢被弄那里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.59,0:06:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你那里最敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我不太清楚欸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.23,0:06:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们帮你确认一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.20,0:06:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,像是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.17,0:06:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头很敏感吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,身体在发抖哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.84,0:06:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头有感觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头站起来啰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头很敏感啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.43,0:06:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,还有那里很敏感呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.90,0:07:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.97,0:07:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不清楚欵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这边吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.92,0:07:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,还是最喜欢这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚听我们那样聊\N是不是让你觉得兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.73,0:07:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是有幻想啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.44,0:07:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你的身上开始流汗咯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你在紧张什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.48,0:07:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,呼吸加快了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.48,0:07:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以摸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.35,0:07:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.42,0:07:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,还是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是敏感呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,站起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,还蛮舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.57,0:08:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要我怎么做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不清楚欵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这样如何
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.06,0:08:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,流了好多汗哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.36,0:08:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不、不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.57,0:08:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有感觉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.37,0:08:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头变的很硬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.32,0:09:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,流了这么多汗真是下流
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好白哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.77,0:09:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头好硬
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.14,0:09:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头的周围有长毛欸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,直接摸比较舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.99,0:09:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越硬了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这样比较好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.04,0:09:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是很兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.07,0:09:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头变的这么硬了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要舔呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,舔了会怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.10,0:10:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.70,0:10:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好暖和哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.34,0:10:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,全身在发抖欸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,身体一直在抖呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.94,0:10:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我也来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.02,0:10:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好、好舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有感觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.89,0:11:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头这么敏感啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.80,0:11:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,下面又怎么样了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.07,0:11:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,变的这么大了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.11,0:11:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好硬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.95,0:11:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.12,0:11:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好硬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还好大哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.93,0:11:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这么大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.80,0:11:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会这么大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好兴奋哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,很兴奋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,直接让我看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.85,0:12:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？害羞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.79,0:12:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为摄影机吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害，内裤都膨胀了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.90,0:12:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,变的这么南
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.80,0:12:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好久没看到这种三角裤了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.17,0:12:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好久没见了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.71,0:12:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.24,0:12:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可以脱下来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.61,0:12:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.89,0:12:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,光是乳头就这么兴奋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.29,0:13:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,硬梆梆的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.83,0:13:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我要摸啰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.68,0:13:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,蛋蛋也很敏感吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.18,0:13:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好硬，一定憋了很多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.56,0:13:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有东西流出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.53,0:13:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,下流的汁流出来啰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.47,0:13:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.87,0:13:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好下流，牵丝了欸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好下流
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真难为情..
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.75,0:13:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,可是汁一直流出来哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你害羞的样子真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.79,0:14:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不停的流出来哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.86,0:14:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害，不停的在流哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.59,0:14:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒越来越大了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.77,0:14:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.28,0:14:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,比刚才更硬了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.06,0:15:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我也开始兴奋起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.00,0:15:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以舔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,可以舔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.94,0:15:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,两个人一起舔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.09,0:15:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好硬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.26,0:15:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害，牵丝了欵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.38,0:16:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,下流的汁好涩哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.42,0:16:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你也来舔看看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.79,0:16:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好涩哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.30,0:16:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这样舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好下流哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.63,0:17:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,真下流
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.55,0:17:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好美味？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.39,0:17:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很美味吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.46,0:18:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吻你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.30,0:18:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,舌头好舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.31,0:18:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,舌头再伸出来一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.30,0:18:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我想看你的屁眼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.31,0:18:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己倒过去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.11,0:18:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,快点嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.92,0:19:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看、让我看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.56,0:19:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.83,0:19:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,全被看光啰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.76,0:19:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.53,0:19:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,手指好像可以插进去哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.14,0:19:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,可以舔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.01,0:19:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,屁眼不停的在动哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.45,0:19:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,蛋蛋也一起舔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.40,0:19:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好硬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.84,0:19:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.35,0:20:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你想看我的那里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,舔我的内裤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,身体越来越热
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.14,0:21:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,美纱也想被舔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.71,0:21:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,流了好多汁哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.45,0:21:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害，牵丝了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你也要舔我的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.67,0:21:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好下流哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.38,0:23:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,还不行射哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.78,0:23:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,还不可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.99,0:23:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,躺下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.14,0:23:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,汗好涩哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.61,0:23:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你流汗了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.84,0:23:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.84,0:23:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,再更兴奋一点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.32,0:23:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还不能射哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.97,0:24:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.52,0:25:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒还很硬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.00,0:25:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.44,0:25:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.12,0:26:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,血管都浮出来啰
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.83,0:26:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越硬了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.09,0:26:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.45,0:28:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,湿答答的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.52,0:28:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.89,0:28:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,有多舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.69,0:28:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服、超舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.30,0:28:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我很开心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.30,0:28:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.14,0:28:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,很让人兴奋哦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.60,0:28:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,湿答答的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.24,0:28:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.94,0:28:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.99,0:29:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,今天由我们为你服务\N我是水木，我是工藤
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.72,0:29:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,请多指教了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.13,0:29:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.10,0:29:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,用精油为你按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.60,0:29:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,为了帮助你放松
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.90,0:29:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,请先把衣服脱下来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.08,0:30:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得不好意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.25,0:30:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.59,0:30:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,请你放松哦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.03,0:30:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得害羞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.63,0:30:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不要紧的，请放松哦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.57,0:30:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,请你先躺下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.52,0:30:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,现在为你涂乳液哦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.23,0:30:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,湿湿滑滑的舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.37,0:30:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,会冷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.24,0:30:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,很热吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.68,0:31:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,把毛巾拿开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.39,0:31:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.22,0:31:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.06,0:31:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,会痒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.57,0:31:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,屁薷也涂上乳液
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.70,0:31:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,很痒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.88,0:31:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,都湿答答了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.52,0:31:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,屁眼动的很厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.86,0:31:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.23,0:31:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好像可以插进去欸
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.33,0:31:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,现在帮你按摩哦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.87,0:32:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,动的好厉害，好可爱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.68,0:32:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,请你多过身来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.55,0:32:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,在发抖，真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.48,0:32:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒多涂一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.62,0:32:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.80,0:32:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,湿湿的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.84,0:32:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,现在帮你涂胸部哦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.12,0:32:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,很硬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.29,0:32:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.56,0:32:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头变的很硬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.57,0:33:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你真可爱..
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.78,0:33:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,湿湿滑滑的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.35,0:33:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以舔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.79,0:33:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我要摸你的乳头哦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.13,0:33:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好滑哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.57,0:34:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.93,0:34:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,变的很硬了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.71,0:34:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你想看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.85,0:35:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.97,0:35:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就特别帮你估
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.44,0:35:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,用力摸
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.61,0:37:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.76,0:37:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,让肉棒变的更滑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.77,0:37:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.13,0:38:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,请看我的屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.42,0:38:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是觉得很兴奋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.68,0:38:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,直接摸也没关系哦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.40,0:39:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,也摸我的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.64,0:39:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,摸这里嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.65,0:41:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,继续摸嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.94,0:41:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,再多摸几下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.91,0:41:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,激烈的摸我嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.39,0:41:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.70,0:41:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒，手指好下流哦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.95,0:42:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒，人家好兴奋哦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.34,0:42:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害，都湿答答了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.79,0:42:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,变的湿答答了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.39,0:43:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,再多摸几下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.67,0:43:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这边也摸嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.09,0:43:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.27,0:43:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒，好舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.97,0:43:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒变的硬梆梆了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.36,0:44:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.80,0:44:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,变的硬梆梆了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.57,0:44:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,下流的汁不停的流出来啰
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.62,0:44:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,人家想让你插进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.29,0:44:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,可以把你的肉棒插进来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.07,0:44:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,一起用屁股挟住它吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.04,0:45:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样，屁股舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.72,0:45:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,可以插进来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.62,0:45:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,请让我插进来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.13,0:45:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我先来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.50,0:45:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,要插啰
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.77,0:46:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,看的到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.14,0:46:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.28,0:46:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒插进去了欵
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.25,0:46:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你要看仔细了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.16,0:46:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,舔人家的那里嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.00,0:47:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒好硬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.64,0:47:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么兴奋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.92,0:47:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,滑滑的好舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.68,0:48:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来换从后面来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.71,0:48:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害好舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.50,0:49:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.28,0:49:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,看的好清楚哦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.01,0:50:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你要看仔细啰
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.43,0:50:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可以再插里面一点哦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.10,0:50:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,再插里面一点嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.54,0:50:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,看的好清楚哦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.40,0:50:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.62,0:51:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,要看清楚啰
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.19,0:51:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒好硬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.33,0:51:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,她的肉穴很湿哦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.60,0:51:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好激烈哦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.07,0:53:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒好硬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.84,0:54:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,理纱的肉穴好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.52,0:54:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,客人的肉棒好舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.37,0:54:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,还这么硬欵
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.20,0:54:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好硬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.58,0:55:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,最后换我来让你射出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.72,0:55:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.10,0:55:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好硬
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.55,0:59:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得如何呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.15,0:59:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得满足了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.05,0:59:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你全身都在发抖哦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.99,0:59:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,身体这么滑
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.93,0:59:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,下次请一定还要再光临本店哦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.10,0:59:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,今天谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.13,1:00:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我都听说了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.03,1:00:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你的成绩退步了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.37,1:00:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈很生气哦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.14,1:00:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我今天特别帮你\N请了英文老师迵来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.81,1:01:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我是英文老师的工藤\N请多指教啰
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.88,1:01:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，偶尔还是得放松一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.62,1:01:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就让两位姐姐来教你\N学校里没教的东西吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.23,1:01:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来上特别的课程吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.64,1:01:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,首先
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.05,1:01:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,先让你看女生舒服的部位吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.75,1:01:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你了解女生的身体吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.36,1:01:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.47,1:02:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这里叫胸部
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.71,1:02:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.55,1:02:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样揉会很舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.92,1:02:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.23,1:02:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这里叫乳头
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.37,1:02:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样抚摸女生会有感觉哦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.18,1:02:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.49,1:03:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这里叫肉穴
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.94,1:03:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,被舔被摸会很舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.51,1:03:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.76,1:03:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样用手指摸会很舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.34,1:03:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.69,1:04:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,直接看
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.07,1:04:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样抚摸
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.97,1:04:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就会发出湿答答的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.31,1:04:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.59,1:04:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,把手指插进来会更舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.73,1:04:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.64,1:04:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,弄这里的小豆子
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.64,1:04:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,会更舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.34,1:05:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.25,1:05:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.56,1:05:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来换她来试范给你看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.76,1:05:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.26,1:05:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.11,1:05:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.05,1:06:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.78,1:06:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.33,1:06:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,肉穴变的湿答答了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.83,1:06:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好兴奋哦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.73,1:07:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.22,1:07:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,很兴奋吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.36,1:07:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.66,1:07:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,还没变大啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.00,1:07:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是太紧张了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.87,1:07:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们来帮你变大吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.81,1:07:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.08,1:07:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.05,1:07:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,包皮拉的好长哦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.33,1:07:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,可以再拉长一点吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.34,1:08:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,拉一这么长啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.61,1:08:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.86,1:08:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,包皮拉的好长哦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.12,1:09:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.59,1:09:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.70,1:09:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,可以舔吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.78,1:09:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你发抖的样子真可爱
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.00,1:10:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.52,1:10:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,开始变大了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.26,1:10:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.20,1:11:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这样舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.37,1:12:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.59,1:13:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.30,1:16:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,抖的好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.37,1:17:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么啦？怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.33,1:19:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,应该还可以再来一次吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.90,1:19:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.31,1:19:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.42,1:19:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,还可以再来一次吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.02,1:20:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,"英语"
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.47,1:23:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,要射了吗？全部射出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.74,1:23:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,已经射出来了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.38,1:23:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才射太多了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.08,1:23:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,其他的部份
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.32,1:24:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,下次再教给你吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.69,1:24:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,下礼拜要加油哦！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.83,1:25:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.33,1:25:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样子不觉得丢脸吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.34,1:25:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,真是变态
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.28,1:25:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然还含着这种东西
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.48,1:25:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,先从这里开始吻吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.73,1:25:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,真是下流
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.81,1:25:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你的肉棒到底有多变态啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.56,1:26:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,真是变态
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.45,1:26:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,穿成这样还变硬了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.15,1:26:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,害羞吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.29,1:26:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真是变稣
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.30,1:27:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是在想下流的事
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.81,1:27:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真是下流的乳头
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.25,1:27:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这样很舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.22,1:27:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的很喜欢这样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.96,1:28:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,下面的肉棒又怎么样了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.64,1:28:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这根变态肉棒是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.54,1:28:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,变硬了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.75,1:28:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,勃起了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.55,1:28:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你看这个
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.70,1:28:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这么舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.97,1:28:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想看
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.15,1:28:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好硬哦
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.42,1:28:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真是下流的肉棒
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.64,1:29:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害，硬梆梆的..
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.33,1:29:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你的肉棒真厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.95,1:30:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要我怎么做啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.23,1:30:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.27,1:30:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,太长了含不住
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.68,1:30:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来换我舔吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.21,1:30:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想舔他的肉棒
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.35,1:31:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,变态肉棒真美味
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.12,1:31:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,人家觉得好兴奋哦
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.44,1:32:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,光这样舔就好舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.25,1:32:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,用我的屁股来帮你做吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.39,1:32:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头都硬了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.71,1:33:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好硬的龟头
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.46,1:33:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.56,1:33:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,再用力一点吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.54,1:33:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.72,1:34:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我也来帮他做吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.42,1:34:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,龟头好硬哦
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.11,1:34:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,硬梆梆的变态肉棒
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.59,1:35:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头很硬，这里也很硬
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.46,1:35:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头和龟头都硬梆梆呢
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.34,1:35:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,人家想要了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.08,1:35:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你也想插进来了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.39,1:35:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,想插进湿答答的肉穴吗
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.59,1:35:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,说出来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.96,1:35:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我想插进你湿答答的肉穴里
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.47,1:35:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,先把手解开吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.02,1:36:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的粗肉棒插进来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.63,1:36:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定很想插进来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.18,1:36:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢插进来了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.09,1:36:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这根变态肉棒是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.43,1:36:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我也插进来啰
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.24,1:37:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你要看清楚啰
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.28,1:37:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,看的到吗
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.42,1:37:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.02,1:37:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,要插进来啰
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.50,1:37:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,又硬又长
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.90,1:38:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒，插到最里面了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.39,1:39:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想要那边的肉棒
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.23,1:39:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要那根肉棒
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.33,1:39:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那就换你来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.64,1:39:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好想要这根肉棒哦
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.21,1:39:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你要看好啰
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.72,1:39:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,肉穴看的很清楚吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.21,1:39:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,插到最里面了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.41,1:44:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.04,1:44:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,插进来了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.74,1:44:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,粗肉棒插进来了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.15,1:44:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,看的好清楚哦
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.12,1:45:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就来舔你的屁眼吧
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.58,1:46:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来从后面来
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.12,1:46:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好硬
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.60,1:46:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.62,1:47:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.21,1:48:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,换我了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.01,1:48:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就舔上面的肉棒吧
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.93,1:50:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,粗肉棒插到肉穴里了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.45,1:50:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.36,1:51:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.43,1:52:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.31,1:52:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,人家还想要欵
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.34,1:52:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,下次再来做吧
