Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.81,1:52:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好多哦
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.42,1:52:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你看、你看
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.22,1:52:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.19,1:53:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,又要射了吗
